@base = http://127.0.0.1:5000/api

### 1) Tüm öğeler -> 200
GET {{base}}/items

### 2) Sadece müsait olanlar -> 200
GET {{base}}/items?available=true

### 3) Sadece kitaplar -> 200
GET {{base}}/items?type=book

### 4) Hatalı filtre -> 400
GET {{base}}/items?type=cd

### 5) Tek öğe -> 200
GET {{base}}/items/1

### 6) Olmayan öğe -> 404
GET {{base}}/items/99

### 7) Kitap ekle -> 201
POST {{base}}/items
Content-Type: application/json

{"type": "book", "title": "The Catcher in the Rye", "author": "J.D. Salinger", "page_count": 220}

### 8) DVD ekle -> 201
POST {{base}}/items
Content-Type: application/json

{"type": "dvd", "title": "Interstellar", "author": "Christopher Nolan", "duration": 169}

### 9) Eksik alanla ekle -> 400
POST {{base}}/items
Content-Type: application/json

{"type": "book", "author": "Someone", "page_count": 100}

### 10) PUT: tüm alanları değiştir -> 200
PUT {{base}}/items/5
Content-Type: application/json

{"title": "Catcher (2nd ed.)", "author": "J.D. Salinger", "page_count": 240}

### 11) PUT eksik alan -> 400
PUT {{base}}/items/5
Content-Type: application/json

{"title": "Only title"}

### 12) PUT olmayan öğe -> 404
PUT {{base}}/items/99
Content-Type: application/json

{"title": "X", "author": "Y", "page_count": 10}

### 13) PATCH: tek alan değiştir -> 200
PATCH {{base}}/items/2
Content-Type: application/json

{"duration": 150}

### 14) PATCH yasak alan -> 400
PATCH {{base}}/items/2
Content-Type: application/json

{"id": 9}

### 15) PATCH olmayan öğe -> 404
PATCH {{base}}/items/99
Content-Type: application/json

{"title": "X"}

### 16) Checkout -> 200
POST {{base}}/items/2/checkout

### 17) Tekrar checkout -> 409
POST {{base}}/items/2/checkout

### 18) Olmayan öğe checkout -> 404
POST {{base}}/items/99/checkout

### 19) Dışarıdaki öğeyi sil -> 409
DELETE {{base}}/items/2

### 20) Return -> 200
POST {{base}}/items/2/return

### 21) Tekrar return -> 409
POST {{base}}/items/2/return

### 22) Olmayan öğe return -> 404
POST {{base}}/items/99/return

### 23) Sil -> 204
DELETE {{base}}/items/2

### 24) Silineni tekrar sil -> 404
DELETE {{base}}/items/2